 8.59987 14 10 14C11.4001 14 12.1002 14 12.635 14.2725C13.1054 14.5122 13.4878 14.8946 13.7275 15.365C14 15.8998 14 16.5999 14 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path opacity="0.4" d="M10 6C10 7.40013 10 8.1002 9.72752 8.63497C9.48783 9.10538 9.10538 9.48783 8.63498 9.72752C8.1002 10 7.40013 10 6 10C4.59987 10 3.8998 10 3.36502 9.72751C2.89462 9.48783 2.51217 9.10538 2.27248 8.63497C2 8.10019 2 7.40013 2 6C2 4.59987 2 3.8998 2.27248 3.36502C2.51217 2.89462 2.89462 2.51217 3.36502 2.27248C3.8998 2 4.59987 2 6 2C7.40013 2 8.1002 2 8.63498 2.27248C9.10538 2.51217 9.48783 2.89462 9.72752 3.36502C10 3.8998 10 4.59987 10 6Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></a> <button${$.attr('aria-label', menuState == true ? "Close Menu" : "Open Menu")} class="relative z-20 -m-2.5 -mr-4 block cursor-pointer p-2.5 lg:hidden">`);

